allocation={'scope':'CONSOLIDATED','period':'FY2025','classification':'RETAINED_RESEARCH_OBSERVATION_NOT_NEW_ADMISSION','jointVentureAssociates':{'openingVnd':'622223692780','newInvestmentVnd':'62898220000','lossShareVnd':'-150558017656','dividendsVnd':'-23379825500','closingVnd':'511184069624'},'source':{**pin(notes),'pointer':'/documents/6/pages/37','pdf':np['pdfEvidence']},'limitation':'This retained note records one adverse investment population, not recurring return on all capex/acquisitions/divestments. Do not divide loss by current-year additions or treat 2024 withdrawal as the 2025 dividend.'}
j=allocation['jointVentureAssociates'];assert sum(int(j[k]) for k in ['openingVnd','newInvestmentVnd','lossShareVnd','dividendsVnd'])==int(j['closingVnd'])
resolution={
'GQ-INC':('METRIC_DEFINITIONS §6.3 / GQ-INC-01','Matched multi-year normalized NOPAT and capital arithmetic is reproducible. None of the retained scenarios qualifies the net book delta as marginal capital; longer windows do not remove classification/scope sensitivity. Annual level ROIC above WACC remains valid S1 support, not marginal return.','Comparable aggregate marginal-capital denominator and corresponding earnings or principle-equivalent economic outcomes sufficient to distinguish the rubric bands. Exact factory/project disclosure is not required.',[ref(s1,'/scenarios'),ref(w,'/incrementalComparability')]),
'CA-REINV':('METRIC_DEFINITIONS §10.1 / CA-REINV-01','FY2025 JV/associate bridge reconciles and shows a loss; core operating earnings improved, and capex/capacity activity exists. This bounds counterevidence but cannot demonstrate repeated destruction or consistently accretive allocation. Mixed is a substantive judgment, not a default for incomplete outcome coverage.','Economic outcome assessment of material retained capital-allocation decisions sufficient for the chosen band; no exhaustive project ledger required. S5 future reinvestment assumptions cannot certify historical outcomes.',[ref(six,'/rows'),ref(notes,'/documents/6/pages/37'),ref(s1,'/historicalAnnualSummary')]),
'CA-DIST':('METRIC_DEFINITIONS §10.2 / CA-DIST-01','S2 six accepted core cases include the declared dividend and pass; minimum surplus retained. FY2025 parent cash payout exceeds current common earnings, with deposit runoff. Neither high payout nor solvency proves opportunity-cost discipline. No reviewed buyback earns invented credit.','Retention/distribution judgment against available reinvestment opportunities and surplus capital. Payability is resolved; missing private deposit terms or exact maturities are not reopened.',[ref(s2,'/coreScenarios'),ref(six,'/metrics')]),
'CA-PSV':('METRIC_DEFINITIONS §10.4 / CA-PSV-01','Recomputed common-after-fund EPS rises nominally across FY2022–2025 but FY2025 growth is weak. Constant shares avoid mechanical dilution uplift. Book value plus cash distribution is positive accounting context, not cycle-adjusted intrinsic compounding; no automatic inflation/historical-return dataset requirement.','Supported cycle/action-adjusted common-owner economic outcome to distinguish real per-share compounding. A current S5 valuation is not a comparable historical intrinsic-value series.',[ref(six,'/commonEarningsPerShareSeries'),ref(six,'/shareActionChronology'),ref(s1,'/method')])}
